WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 15]

02:17.200 --> 02:18.260
Practicing dark arts,

02:18.750 --> 02:19.820
harming fellow disciples,

02:20.150 --> 02:21.220
unforgivable!

02:49.120 --> 02:50.850
Thank you for saving me, Mentor Hongfu.

02:53.120 --> 02:53.690
What happened?

02:54.870 --> 02:55.620
Mentor Wu caught Ye

02:55.840 --> 02:56.690
meeting someone

02:56.920 --> 02:58.050
from the demonic sects.

02:58.950 --> 02:59.620
He tried

02:59.710 --> 03:00.410
to silence him.

03:01.280 --> 03:02.180
I walked into it.

03:03.120 --> 03:04.770
I meant to escort Mentor Wu to my cavern.

03:05.640 --> 03:06.290
However,

03:07.230 --> 03:08.570
that traitor still took his life.

03:09.430 --> 03:10.460
Those wicked cultivators

03:11.640 --> 03:12.620
won't get away with it.

03:13.560 --> 03:14.770
Mentor Wu wanted me

03:15.230 --> 03:15.930
to report it

03:16.230 --> 03:16.980
to the Sect Master.

03:18.400 --> 03:19.050
The demonic sects

03:19.280 --> 03:20.620
had planted spies in the Seven Sects.

03:21.000 --> 03:21.490
Also,

03:22.430 --> 03:23.620
Spirit Beast Mountain is suspicious.

03:26.280 --> 03:27.020
So it really was him.

03:28.070 --> 03:28.900
Fellow Han.

03:32.120 --> 03:33.100
This matter is too important

03:33.710 --> 03:35.330
for a Foundation Establishment Stage disciple

03:35.560 --> 03:36.460
to get involved.

03:37.350 --> 03:38.410
I will have it investigated.

03:39.150 --> 03:40.290
Focus on your cultivation.

03:41.000 --> 03:42.460
Do not let word of this spread.

03:42.950 --> 03:43.460
Yes.

03:49.080 --> 03:49.780
I didn't expect

03:50.520 --> 03:51.410
that after years apart,

03:52.280 --> 03:54.380
you would become Huayuan's disciple

03:54.560 --> 03:55.690
and reach the Foundation Establishment.

03:56.960 --> 03:58.220
I owe it to my master and mentors

03:58.960 --> 03:59.820
for their guidance.

04:01.520 --> 04:02.730
You sure know how to be polite.

04:04.470 --> 04:05.450
Maybe back then,

04:05.840 --> 04:06.850
I underestimated you.

04:08.560 --> 04:09.410
But don't forget

04:10.000 --> 04:10.980
the path of cultivation

04:11.310 --> 04:12.290
is like rowing upstream.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.100
Move forward, or fall behind.

04:15.120 --> 04:15.940
You still need

04:16.150 --> 04:17.130
to keep up the good work.

04:18.680 --> 04:19.100
I will

04:19.240 --> 04:19.940
keep that in mind.

04:24.750 --> 04:26.340
Report Wu Mian's death to the sect.

04:26.630 --> 04:27.780
Give him a proper burial.

05:13.400 --> 05:13.980
Mentor Wu,

05:15.310 --> 05:16.290
this is the other half

05:16.800 --> 05:18.290
of the moxa stick I used on you.

05:30.910 --> 05:31.610
Mentor Wu,

05:34.430 --> 05:36.380
you told me to start calling you Senior Wu.

05:38.470 --> 05:40.130
But I still want to call you Mentor.

05:44.800 --> 05:46.940
If you hadn't reminded me to switch the formation,

05:48.630 --> 05:49.450
I wouldn't have

05:51.750 --> 05:52.810
survived yesterday's battle.

06:02.040 --> 06:02.490
Look.

06:05.270 --> 06:06.460
We are near my cavern.

06:07.360 --> 06:08.170
The view is beautiful.

06:09.950 --> 06:11.370
It's the view you always liked.

06:12.040 --> 06:13.220
It has the stream you loved.

06:14.240 --> 06:15.980
And the rock where you used to sit.

06:29.120 --> 06:29.660
Han Li.

06:32.560 --> 06:33.700
It's pouring out here.

06:34.270 --> 06:35.050
Stop standing there!

06:35.680 --> 06:36.540
Head back now!

06:51.000 --> 06:51.850
From now on,

06:52.360 --> 06:53.490
you may call me Mentor Wu.

06:54.720 --> 06:55.340
Welcome

06:55.920 --> 06:56.810
to Yellow Maple Valley.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.410
Whether you reach Foundation Establishment or not,

07:00.160 --> 07:01.050
this Foundation Pill

07:01.360 --> 07:02.410
must be kept safe.

07:03.040 --> 07:04.020
If you need money,

07:04.680 --> 07:05.220
go to Baiji Hall

07:05.750 --> 07:06.490
and take more jobs.

07:07.270 --> 07:08.370
Just say I sent you.

07:09.040 --> 07:10.900
Your spiritual aura is still too thin.

07:11.240 --> 07:12.660
Channel it into your feet,

07:13.070 --> 07:13.610
and try again.

07:16.360 --> 07:17.410
Your spirit root may be weak,

07:17.720 --> 07:18.700
but you are diligent.

07:19.240 --> 07:19.980
With time,

07:20.390 --> 07:21.370
you will become great.

07:24.240 --> 07:24.850
Mentor Wu.

07:27.720 --> 07:29.290
You really cared about me.

07:48.680 --> 07:49.460
What path

07:49.720 --> 07:51.290
[Council Hall, Yan Clan Stronghold]
should Yan Clan Stronghold take going forward?

07:52.040 --> 07:52.540
Everyone,

07:53.240 --> 07:54.170
what are your thoughts?

07:57.800 --> 07:58.610
My Lord,

07:59.120 --> 07:59.730
the stronghold

07:59.920 --> 08:00.660
has always been

08:00.830 --> 08:02.900
the Yue Kingdom's first line of defense against the demonic sects.

08:03.240 --> 08:04.370
If we defect,

08:04.950 --> 08:05.780
won't Yue Kingdom

08:06.000 --> 08:07.580
be completely exposed?

08:08.870 --> 08:10.980
It would give the demonic sects free access.

08:11.480 --> 08:12.020
That's right.

08:12.950 --> 08:14.490
Three hundred years ago,

08:14.870 --> 08:17.220
we broke free from the grip of the Six Demonic Sects.

08:18.040 --> 08:18.700
There's no way

08:18.950 --> 08:20.140
we would join them again.

08:22.680 --> 08:23.900
What is good and what is evil?

08:29.040 --> 08:31.050
It all comes down to who wins and who loses.

08:31.920 --> 08:32.900
A thousand years ago,

08:33.040 --> 08:35.610
the Seven Sects were nothing more than rebels of the Six Sects.

08:36.480 --> 08:38.540
And now they claim to be righteous?

08:40.680 --> 08:42.580
Young Lady Yan is gravely ill.

08:43.240 --> 08:44.810
The Seven Sects have done nothing to help.

08:46.040 --> 08:47.730
Where is the Blood Spirit Flower they promised?

08:48.630 --> 08:49.930
Do they truly not have it?

08:50.430 --> 08:51.610
Or are they afraid the Yan Clan

08:51.800 --> 08:53.020
will have

08:53.040 --> 08:54.460
a Nascent Soul cultivator

08:54.920 --> 08:56.290
and turn the Seven Sects into Eight?

08:57.480 --> 08:59.780
The Six Sects have always welcomed those

09:00.390 --> 09:01.410
who turn to the light.

09:02.190 --> 09:02.850
I speak on behalf

09:03.600 --> 09:04.410
of my father,

09:04.870 --> 09:05.730
Sect Leader Wang Tiangu

09:06.510 --> 09:07.730
of the Ghost Spirit Sect.

09:08.240 --> 09:09.580
I promise you all,

09:10.070 --> 09:11.540
if the Yan Clan Stronghold returns to

09:12.120 --> 09:12.780
the Virtuous Sect,

09:13.240 --> 09:14.980
we will treat you as equals.

09:15.190 --> 09:16.370
All cultivation resources

09:16.600 --> 09:17.610
and supreme techniques

09:18.270 --> 09:19.290
will be shared with you.

09:20.070 --> 09:20.810
We will be equals.

09:21.600 --> 09:22.170
What say you?

09:23.920 --> 09:25.050
Are these terms

09:26.120 --> 09:27.050
not generous enough?

09:28.430 --> 09:29.410
How can we trust you?

09:29.560 --> 09:30.340
- Yeah. - That's right.

09:30.430 --> 09:31.370
Why should we trust you?

09:41.480 --> 09:42.220
The Truedeath Oath!

09:42.600 --> 09:43.610
It's the Truedeath Oath!

09:44.000 --> 09:44.610
My Lord!

09:59.870 --> 10:00.290
My Lord!

10:00.680 --> 10:01.250
That's right.

10:01.800 --> 10:03.020
Young Master Wang

10:03.310 --> 10:04.780
swore that oath with me.

10:05.480 --> 10:07.490
He staked his life to earn our trust.

10:10.080 --> 10:11.650
He is willing to bet his life

10:12.360 --> 10:13.530
that he can cure Yan.

10:16.550 --> 10:17.460
With such courage,

10:18.000 --> 10:18.850
even I

10:19.750 --> 10:20.980
have to respect him.

10:24.240 --> 10:24.730
All of you

10:25.120 --> 10:26.340
have followed me for many years.

10:26.670 --> 10:27.130
There is no harm

10:27.390 --> 10:28.580
in trusting me one more time.

10:29.120 --> 10:29.850
I hope you

10:30.240 --> 10:31.650
will keep your promise today.

10:32.150 --> 10:33.420
Do not let us down.

10:33.840 --> 10:34.890
Of course.

10:35.390 --> 10:35.980
From now on,

10:36.150 --> 10:37.300
we are one family.

10:38.080 --> 10:38.580
I also hope

10:38.790 --> 10:39.700
the senior members here

10:40.080 --> 10:41.250
will not hesitate to lend a hand.

10:42.080 --> 10:43.220
After all, Yan Clan Stronghold

10:43.480 --> 10:44.370
and Ghost Spirit Sect

10:45.510 --> 10:46.700
are united as one.

10:49.790 --> 10:50.980
We share glory and hardship.

10:58.830 --> 10:59.530
The fight paid off.

10:59.710 --> 11:01.650
I got the Great Deployment Art from Ye.

11:01.960 --> 11:03.640
So all those wooden carvings of his

11:03.810 --> 11:04.880
were actually puppets.

11:05.000 --> 11:05.460
Don't move.

11:23.200 --> 11:24.220
Something feels off.

11:34.150 --> 11:34.940
You're jealous.

11:35.960 --> 11:36.820
I'm carving you,

11:37.240 --> 11:37.940
and you're jealous?

11:42.750 --> 11:43.460
Play elsewhere.

11:45.480 --> 11:46.060
Just go.

11:47.390 --> 11:48.010
Go now.

11:50.080 --> 11:50.460
Fine.

11:51.320 --> 11:51.820
If you won't go,

11:52.150 --> 11:52.610
I will.

11:56.390 --> 11:57.130
I played the wrong tile.

11:59.150 --> 11:59.580
Mine.

11:59.840 --> 12:00.300
Hongfu.

12:04.440 --> 12:04.980
West Wind.

12:08.120 --> 12:08.980
West Wind.

12:12.320 --> 12:12.610
Red Dragon.

12:17.670 --> 12:18.650
Don't waste your time.

12:18.670 --> 12:19.130
Four Characters.

12:20.240 --> 12:22.490
This tile was carved from the bones of a Level 4

12:22.510 --> 12:23.340
demon beast.

12:23.720 --> 12:25.770
Specifically made to prevent cheaters like you.

12:26.840 --> 12:28.700
No wonder I couldn't see anything.

12:31.750 --> 12:33.130
Come on, old gambler,

12:33.390 --> 12:34.700
we're betting on medicinal wine.

12:34.910 --> 12:36.100
Do you have to be this guarded?

12:36.670 --> 12:37.530
Look at you.

12:37.600 --> 12:38.220
You live life

12:38.440 --> 12:39.530
tight-fisted and stingy.

12:39.750 --> 12:40.980
No wonder Fairy Nangong stopped coming.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.100
Save it.

12:42.360 --> 12:43.650
Nangong was unfortunately

12:43.840 --> 12:44.610
injured.

12:45.480 --> 12:46.460
Then, she fought

12:46.480 --> 12:48.130
with that demonic spy.

12:48.240 --> 12:49.060
Now she's healing.

12:49.720 --> 12:50.420
Otherwise,

12:50.600 --> 12:52.060
you wouldn't be sitting at this table.

12:52.670 --> 12:53.980
You're just afraid I'll win.

12:54.270 --> 12:55.580
Everyone knows in mahjong,

12:56.200 --> 12:57.460
you feed the player before you,

12:57.550 --> 12:58.460
block the one after you.

12:58.670 --> 12:59.650
Stop the one across from you.

13:00.270 --> 13:01.340
I wonder if Elder Han

13:01.670 --> 13:03.530
thinks the same way about the three of us.

13:06.480 --> 13:08.060
It was my failure to discipline the sect.

13:09.000 --> 13:11.130
I let a demonic spy slip into Spirit Beast Mountain.

13:12.870 --> 13:13.650
So you're saying

13:13.670 --> 13:15.060
you've already identified the spy?

13:15.910 --> 13:17.420
A Qi Refining disciple named Zhong Wu.

13:18.320 --> 13:19.220
He let the demonic sects

13:19.360 --> 13:20.580
into the Bloody Trial Ground.

13:21.600 --> 13:22.850
I wanted to interrogate him,

13:23.600 --> 13:24.610
but he escaped

13:24.670 --> 13:25.650
before I could catch him.

13:26.120 --> 13:27.460
But I issued a wanted notice.

13:29.030 --> 13:30.850
A Qi Refining disciple

13:30.870 --> 13:31.850
managed to escape

13:31.870 --> 13:33.060
from Spirit Beast Mountain?

13:33.550 --> 13:34.820
And you still haven't found him?

13:36.240 --> 13:36.700
Chick.

13:39.080 --> 13:40.130
I'll do everything to find him

13:40.550 --> 13:41.610
and clear the Spirit Beast Mountain's name.

13:42.550 --> 13:43.650
You will have justice.

13:45.150 --> 13:45.490
Draw a tile.

13:47.910 --> 13:48.420
Nine Characters.

13:48.790 --> 13:50.180
The name Zhong Wu reminded me

13:50.390 --> 13:51.180
of something.

13:52.120 --> 13:53.010
In my sect,

13:53.030 --> 13:54.100
a Foundation Establishment cultivator

13:54.200 --> 13:55.220
named Ye disappeared.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.340
Before he vanished,

13:56.840 --> 13:57.610
a disciple saw him

13:57.720 --> 13:58.610
talking with two people

13:58.960 --> 14:00.100
dressed like

14:00.120 --> 14:01.700
Spirit Beast Mountain disciples.

14:02.030 --> 14:02.730
Hurry up!

14:02.750 --> 14:03.420
Come on!

14:04.550 --> 14:05.460
Could it be

14:05.720 --> 14:06.700
Zhong Wu again?

14:14.960 --> 14:15.420
Sorry.

14:15.670 --> 14:16.130
Self-draw.

14:18.200 --> 14:19.580
Fu Yunzi, were you even listening?

14:19.840 --> 14:20.300
I heard you.

14:20.390 --> 14:21.420
But I was playing too.

14:21.550 --> 14:21.980
Exactly.

14:22.080 --> 14:23.650
We're discussing serious matters here.

14:23.910 --> 14:25.060
It doesn't stop us from playing.

14:25.080 --> 14:25.730
I won.

14:25.910 --> 14:26.980
That was a winning hand.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.010
You're cheating again.

14:28.200 --> 14:28.980
What kind of...

14:29.000 --> 14:29.490
Alright.

14:29.630 --> 14:30.530
Just hurry up already.

14:30.910 --> 14:31.180
You.

14:32.320 --> 14:33.580
Come on.

14:34.150 --> 14:35.100
Listen up.

14:36.080 --> 14:37.650
Just like what Hongfu said,

14:37.790 --> 14:38.580
that guy named Ye,

14:38.670 --> 14:39.700
and also your guy,

14:39.870 --> 14:40.490
Zhong Wu,

14:41.480 --> 14:42.300
are lurking

14:42.510 --> 14:44.100
all throughout the Seven Sects.

14:44.360 --> 14:45.100
There are too many.

14:45.480 --> 14:45.940
So,

14:45.960 --> 14:46.530
we must all

14:46.960 --> 14:48.060
stay alert.

14:49.030 --> 14:50.130
Including against them.

14:51.200 --> 14:51.610
What?

14:51.670 --> 14:53.220
Can't I be a little sneaky at the game?

14:54.030 --> 14:54.730
Hongfu,

14:54.960 --> 14:55.580
Li,

14:55.910 --> 14:56.490
and Fu Yunzi,

14:57.630 --> 14:59.370
we've all been good friends for years.

15:00.550 --> 15:02.700
The demonic sects are our sworn enemies.

15:03.440 --> 15:04.300
I can't speak for others,

15:04.600 --> 15:05.420
but as long as I live,

15:06.000 --> 15:07.580
I won't let them take Spirit Beast Mountain.

15:10.960 --> 15:12.940
Even though strange things have happened lately,

15:13.600 --> 15:14.460
I, Hongfu,

15:14.480 --> 15:15.220
have never once

15:15.320 --> 15:16.300
doubted you.

15:16.670 --> 15:17.490
Don't take

15:17.790 --> 15:18.250
any offense.

15:23.150 --> 15:23.700
Master.

15:24.150 --> 15:25.010
- Xuan'er. - Just picked this for you.

15:25.200 --> 15:25.610
I don't want it.

15:26.500 --> 15:27.010
Mentor.

15:27.390 --> 15:27.820
No.

15:28.440 --> 15:29.010
We're busy here.

15:29.480 --> 15:30.100
Off you go now.

15:30.600 --> 15:31.250
Official business.

15:31.720 --> 15:32.300
Go on.

15:32.870 --> 15:33.220
Alright.

15:35.480 --> 15:36.060
That kid

15:36.150 --> 15:36.490
is sweet.

15:37.360 --> 15:37.850
Yeah.

15:39.910 --> 15:40.940
Given what happened today,

15:41.390 --> 15:43.180
should we have the disciples leave the room?

15:44.240 --> 15:44.730
Why?

15:46.000 --> 15:46.980
She's fine.

15:47.510 --> 15:48.700
She's not the type to care

15:48.750 --> 15:49.650
about what we say.

15:49.870 --> 15:50.220
Exactly.

15:50.960 --> 15:51.890
My disciple just reached

15:52.270 --> 15:53.770
the Foundation Establishment Stage.

15:54.550 --> 15:56.180
Her progress has completely stalled.

15:56.200 --> 15:57.100
It's driving me crazy.

15:57.750 --> 15:58.700
That's easy, Hongfu.

15:58.910 --> 15:59.770
Just find her a...

16:00.910 --> 16:01.490
a companion.

16:02.080 --> 16:02.460
A companion.

16:05.390 --> 16:05.850
Master.

16:06.320 --> 16:06.700
Mentor.

16:07.200 --> 16:07.730
The Sect Master

16:07.910 --> 16:08.820
wants you to have this.

16:09.600 --> 16:10.060
What is it?

16:11.790 --> 16:12.250
Blank tile.

16:12.620 --> 16:15.580
[A wedding invitation from Yan Ruyan]

16:15.790 --> 16:16.850
That's great news.

16:18.480 --> 16:18.980
Hongfu, look.

16:20.360 --> 16:22.250
Shouldn't Yellow Maple Valley send someone

16:22.270 --> 16:23.340
with a gift as well?

16:24.480 --> 16:25.460
They have a wedding.

16:25.840 --> 16:26.460
Let me see it.

16:28.440 --> 16:29.580
The Lord of the Yan Clan Stronghold

16:29.750 --> 16:30.940
is marrying off his daughter.

16:31.240 --> 16:32.460
Ruyan is getting married.

16:32.960 --> 16:33.690
Wonderful!

16:33.690 --> 16:34.180
Oh, right,

16:34.480 --> 16:34.850
Wu Xuan,

16:34.910 --> 16:37.180
go gather the disciples.

16:37.510 --> 16:38.250
Yes, Master.

16:38.480 --> 16:38.730
Come on.

16:40.480 --> 16:41.180
You sure you've got the right number of cards?

16:41.440 --> 16:41.820
No.

16:43.270 --> 16:44.370
This is all your fault.

16:50.630 --> 16:51.420
The Great Deployment Art

16:51.840 --> 16:52.940
can temper the spirit sense,

16:53.440 --> 16:54.610
and help with the Projection Technique.

16:55.870 --> 16:56.980
Even in battle,

16:57.320 --> 16:58.530
it can control more puppets.

16:59.600 --> 17:00.490
That's incredible.

17:01.600 --> 17:03.770
I wonder what brilliant mind created this.

17:10.030 --> 17:10.580
Get up!

17:26.000 --> 17:27.940
I must expand my spirit sense a bit more.

17:47.870 --> 17:48.420
Han Li.

17:49.080 --> 17:50.130
Come over here.

17:52.390 --> 17:53.490
Master is looking for me?

18:00.630 --> 18:01.060
Over here.

18:02.440 --> 18:02.820
Master.

18:03.320 --> 18:03.770
You called?

18:04.440 --> 18:05.010
We've been waiting.

18:05.440 --> 18:05.890
Hurry.

18:06.080 --> 18:06.580
Stand still.

18:10.150 --> 18:11.100
Here's the thing.

18:12.630 --> 18:14.060
The young Lord of Yan Clan Stronghold,

18:14.390 --> 18:14.940
Yan Ruyan,

18:15.080 --> 18:16.460
is getting married soon.

18:17.440 --> 18:17.770
So,

18:18.910 --> 18:20.580
the Lord of Yan Clan sent us an invitation.

18:20.960 --> 18:22.530
Each sect needs to send representatives

18:22.670 --> 18:23.980
to attend the wedding banquet.

18:24.550 --> 18:25.890
Mentor Hongfu

18:26.320 --> 18:27.370
is sending Xuan'er.

18:28.560 --> 18:29.650
One more spot left.

18:30.240 --> 18:30.820
Now tell me,

18:31.630 --> 18:32.300
who wants to go?

18:39.270 --> 18:40.180
Here, Hongfu.

18:40.590 --> 18:41.140
Have some tea.

18:41.480 --> 18:41.980
Never mind.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.090
See?

18:47.640 --> 18:49.570
Just as I thought.

18:51.880 --> 18:52.980
Song Meng is too aggressive.

18:53.750 --> 18:54.620
And Weiniang

18:54.640 --> 18:55.730
is way too naive.

18:56.750 --> 18:57.940
As for Jing,

18:59.110 --> 19:00.050
he's too rigid.

19:00.310 --> 19:01.220
Not very adaptable.

19:02.270 --> 19:03.200
Now, you two...

19:03.400 --> 19:04.180
Master.

19:04.640 --> 19:05.330
My cultivation

19:06.000 --> 19:06.940
is lacking.

19:07.310 --> 19:08.010
I'm bad at socializing.

19:09.070 --> 19:10.180
This mission is important.

19:10.550 --> 19:11.530
You need proper etiquette,

19:12.160 --> 19:13.250
and look after Senior Dong.

19:14.110 --> 19:14.810
With all that,

19:15.480 --> 19:16.530
Senior Wu is the best fit.

19:18.960 --> 19:19.810
Get back here.

19:20.350 --> 19:21.250
Who told you to leave?

19:22.440 --> 19:23.660
What you just said was wrong.

19:24.200 --> 19:25.620
Xuan'er reached her stage later than you.

19:25.790 --> 19:26.380
By the rules,

19:26.960 --> 19:28.530
she should be calling you senior.

19:29.350 --> 19:29.700
Besides,

19:29.880 --> 19:30.700
from what I've seen,

19:31.160 --> 19:32.050
you two are the only ones

19:32.200 --> 19:33.420
she really talks to.

19:34.830 --> 19:35.380
So...

19:37.550 --> 19:38.180
Hongfu,

19:40.400 --> 19:40.810
you decide.

19:41.510 --> 19:42.290
You want me to pick?

19:42.720 --> 19:43.490
You make the call.

19:58.790 --> 19:59.570
I pick Han Li.

20:01.270 --> 20:01.940
That boy

20:02.030 --> 20:03.250
isn't much to look at,

20:03.830 --> 20:04.900
but he seems steady enough.

20:07.160 --> 20:08.700
Hongfu, you have great eyes.

20:08.720 --> 20:09.220
This kid

20:09.590 --> 20:10.730
has always been levelheaded.

20:11.030 --> 20:11.900
Reminds me of my younger days.

20:11.920 --> 20:12.460
Alright then.

20:12.880 --> 20:13.700
It's settled.

20:14.620 --> 20:15.180
Indeed.

20:15.200 --> 20:16.770
If there's nothing else, we'll go now.

20:16.880 --> 20:17.570
Come on, Xuan'er.

20:17.830 --> 20:18.900
We'll each prepare our gifts.

20:18.920 --> 20:19.380
Sure.

20:19.510 --> 20:19.940
Sure.

20:20.240 --> 20:20.900
Han Li,

20:21.240 --> 20:21.730
prepare

20:21.920 --> 20:22.330
the gift.

20:22.550 --> 20:23.380
Hongfu, I'll walk you out.

20:23.590 --> 20:24.050
No need.

20:24.440 --> 20:25.180
We're headed the same way.

20:25.310 --> 20:25.700
Let's go.

20:25.830 --> 20:26.420
Han,

20:27.920 --> 20:28.860
it's a big responsibility

20:29.270 --> 20:29.860
to protect Xuan'er.

20:30.750 --> 20:31.660
Let's go.

20:32.000 --> 20:32.420
Oh, right.

20:32.920 --> 20:34.180
Prepare a proper gift.

20:35.400 --> 20:36.530
- So naggy. - Let's move.

20:44.200 --> 20:45.010
Just my luck.

20:45.880 --> 20:47.140
Now I have to bring a gift too.

20:49.160 --> 20:49.660
No way.

20:50.400 --> 20:51.090
I must ask Master

20:51.400 --> 20:52.180
for a reward in return.

20:55.440 --> 20:56.810
I saw people from the Yan Clan Stronghold.

20:57.510 --> 20:58.330
Does that mean Qing

20:58.440 --> 20:59.250
came back too?

21:00.310 --> 21:01.530
They delivered a wedding invite.

21:02.440 --> 21:03.090
A wedding invite?

21:03.720 --> 21:04.900
Yan Ruyan is getting married.

21:06.550 --> 21:07.770
That is so sudden.

21:08.830 --> 21:09.810
Lately, Ruyan has only been

21:09.830 --> 21:11.330
focused on cultivating.

21:11.830 --> 21:13.220
Marriage is the last thing on her mind.

21:16.750 --> 21:17.250
Master,

21:18.070 --> 21:19.380
about the wedding trip...

21:19.720 --> 21:20.490
During this journey,

21:20.720 --> 21:21.900
you must look after

21:21.920 --> 21:22.900
your junior Xuan'er.

21:23.960 --> 21:26.420
Do not give your Mentor Hongfu any reason to worry.

21:27.160 --> 21:27.810
Your wish

21:28.030 --> 21:28.860
is my command.

21:31.640 --> 21:32.380
But the thing is,

21:32.510 --> 21:33.570
I've only mastered one thing

21:34.110 --> 21:35.050
that you taught me.

21:35.920 --> 21:36.770
If something happens

21:36.790 --> 21:38.420
on the road with Xuan'er,

21:40.310 --> 21:41.900
I'm afraid I might not be much help.

21:46.030 --> 21:47.140
You rascal.

21:47.590 --> 21:48.570
You look so honest,

21:48.830 --> 21:50.050
but you have plenty of schemes.

21:52.830 --> 21:53.900
You sound like my disciple.

21:55.000 --> 21:55.380
Come here.

21:58.680 --> 22:00.140
I did promise to teach you

22:00.720 --> 22:01.490
a new skill

22:01.790 --> 22:03.090
upon reaching Foundation Establishment.

22:07.920 --> 22:08.660
It's all here.

22:09.200 --> 22:09.860
Pick one.

22:10.480 --> 22:11.290
Thank you, Master.

22:17.640 --> 22:19.140
Only one.

22:24.900 --> 22:28.620
[Restoration Technique]

22:34.340 --> 22:35.350
[Phantom Technique, Restoration Technique]

22:35.350 --> 22:36.050
Restoration Technique.

22:36.880 --> 22:37.490
Phantom Technique.

22:38.550 --> 22:39.420
Both are pretty solid.

22:40.480 --> 22:41.460
But they don't really

22:41.640 --> 22:42.900
stand out in any special way.

22:44.200 --> 22:45.250
The included techniques

22:45.270 --> 22:46.900
are a shield and a phantom clone.

22:48.000 --> 22:49.730
But those are part of the Cyan Sword Technique.

22:51.400 --> 22:52.900
These two don't seem worth picking.

22:58.590 --> 22:59.620
This silver page

23:00.270 --> 23:01.140
looks a lot like

23:01.160 --> 23:02.900
the golden one I found in the Trial Ground.

23:03.550 --> 23:04.460
I wonder if

23:04.750 --> 23:05.620
there's any connection.

23:12.110 --> 23:12.570
Master,

23:13.400 --> 23:14.180
I picked this one.

23:15.070 --> 23:15.860
You've decided?

23:18.160 --> 23:18.770
Are you sure?

23:19.720 --> 23:20.180
I'm sure.

23:21.720 --> 23:23.180
Out of all these techniques,

23:23.790 --> 23:24.570
you picked none

23:24.960 --> 23:26.250
and went straight for that one?

23:27.160 --> 23:28.530
That's a surprise to me.

23:29.400 --> 23:31.220
Do you have a sharp eye,

23:31.270 --> 23:32.530
or just good luck?

23:34.720 --> 23:35.330
Just lucky.

23:37.680 --> 23:38.180
Alright then.

23:39.310 --> 23:40.620
Hurry back and get ready.

23:40.750 --> 23:41.770
Set out as soon as you can.

23:42.720 --> 23:43.490
Yes, Master.

23:53.880 --> 23:55.220
That's my disciple.

24:08.480 --> 24:09.900
The golden page I got

24:10.270 --> 24:11.660
and the silver one Master gave me...

24:12.880 --> 24:13.730
This silver page

24:14.160 --> 24:15.700
feels heavier than the gold one.

24:16.400 --> 24:17.290
Channeling spiritual energy.

24:40.240 --> 24:41.900
It's the complete Cyan Sword Technique!

25:20.270 --> 25:21.290
Qingzhu Swarm Sword.

25:22.240 --> 25:23.490
A Core Formation Stage treasure.

25:25.750 --> 25:26.810
A full set has twelve swords.

25:27.440 --> 25:28.380
Several sets can be

25:28.680 --> 25:29.420
deployed at once.

25:30.400 --> 25:31.180
If I can craft one too,

25:31.830 --> 25:32.810
that will be amazing.

25:48.830 --> 25:50.010
Triple Cycle Core Rebirth.

25:50.920 --> 25:52.770
Is this an auxiliary art to the Cyan Sword Technique?

25:55.440 --> 25:56.330
When I reach Tier 6,

25:56.720 --> 25:57.620
as the peak of Foundation Establishment,

25:58.270 --> 25:59.180
I must disperse my power.

26:00.000 --> 26:00.810
Repeat this three times,

26:01.200 --> 26:02.490
and Core Formation will be reached.

26:17.000 --> 26:18.380
I started dispersing my power

26:18.400 --> 26:19.330
at Tier 4.

26:20.270 --> 26:21.810
So it was meant to compress spiritual power

26:21.960 --> 26:22.860
and form cultivation core

26:23.960 --> 26:26.220
Someone used this to overcome the Core Formation bottleneck...

26:26.920 --> 26:28.570
The founder of the Cyan Sword Technique

26:29.000 --> 26:30.140
was truly brilliant.

26:31.510 --> 26:32.620
But then again,

26:32.920 --> 26:34.250
this means I must redo it three times.

26:35.830 --> 26:36.900
Can I really do that

26:37.270 --> 26:38.250
in this lifetime?

26:59.790 --> 27:00.530
You little rascal.

27:01.160 --> 27:01.770
You should be

27:02.270 --> 27:02.900
guarding the door.

27:05.920 --> 27:06.860
Han!

27:06.920 --> 27:07.700
It's us.

27:07.790 --> 27:08.460
Han!

27:15.790 --> 27:16.620
This cavern is huge.

27:16.750 --> 27:17.810
What a nice place.

27:17.830 --> 27:18.530
Really nice.

27:18.790 --> 27:19.140
Han.

27:19.240 --> 27:20.490
This cavern of yours is impressive.

27:20.720 --> 27:21.700
Is that the spirit spring?

27:21.880 --> 27:22.660
Spirit spring!

27:25.030 --> 27:25.730
It really is.

27:27.160 --> 27:28.660
Can't let them see my herb garden.

27:30.310 --> 27:31.140
My seniors.

27:31.200 --> 27:31.810
Look at this water.

27:31.830 --> 27:32.620
Not bad, right?

27:32.720 --> 27:34.050
I can't believe there is one here.

27:34.440 --> 27:35.330
My seniors!

27:37.160 --> 27:38.010
What brings you here?

27:40.720 --> 27:41.420
Where is Senior Wu?

27:42.440 --> 27:43.730
Wu Xuan is...

27:44.720 --> 27:45.220
Han,

27:45.640 --> 27:46.900
what gift are you bringing

27:47.160 --> 27:47.980
to the wedding?

27:49.880 --> 27:50.980
I almost forgot about that.

27:52.590 --> 27:53.250
We're here

27:53.480 --> 27:54.490
to help you brainstorm.

27:55.160 --> 27:56.420
I heard the bride from the Yan Clan

27:56.440 --> 27:57.660
is a cultivator from the Moonshadow Sect.

27:58.110 --> 27:58.900
You're skilled in alchemy,

27:59.240 --> 28:00.140
why not refine something

28:00.440 --> 28:01.730
to aid in cultivation as a gift?

28:02.160 --> 28:02.700
A gift

28:03.030 --> 28:03.940
should be practical.

28:04.270 --> 28:05.530
You're the one talking nonsense.

28:06.070 --> 28:07.290
They are marrying off a daughter.

28:07.720 --> 28:09.460
Han is skilled in medicine and herbs.

28:09.750 --> 28:10.810
He should make

28:11.070 --> 28:12.290
a nourishing beauty cream.

28:12.640 --> 28:13.570
Now that's thoughtful.

28:14.160 --> 28:15.420
Not everyone is staring

28:15.680 --> 28:16.860
at the mirror all day like you.

28:17.200 --> 28:18.660
I just saw you looking in the mirror.

28:18.680 --> 28:19.090
Didn't I?

28:19.160 --> 28:20.250
When did I look in a mirror?

28:20.270 --> 28:20.860
Every day.

28:20.880 --> 28:21.530
Alright.

28:21.550 --> 28:22.530
We're trying to help Han.

28:22.790 --> 28:23.620
Quit messing around.

28:24.750 --> 28:25.290
Han.

28:27.960 --> 28:28.940
No matter what you prepare,

28:29.000 --> 28:29.810
just remember this.

28:30.160 --> 28:31.620
You're representing Yellow Maple Valley.

28:34.640 --> 28:35.570
I will keep that in mind.

28:36.590 --> 28:37.460
One thing eludes me.

28:38.270 --> 28:39.180
Seniors.

28:39.310 --> 28:40.810
You seem very interested in this wedding,

28:41.400 --> 28:42.620
so why did you dodge it

28:43.070 --> 28:44.250
when Master asked?

28:45.200 --> 28:46.090
Well...

28:47.440 --> 28:48.730
Of course we want to go for fun.

28:49.400 --> 28:49.900
But

28:49.960 --> 28:51.140
didn't Mentor Hongfu name

28:51.240 --> 28:52.180
Dong Xuan'er to attend?

28:52.480 --> 28:53.140
It wouldn't

28:53.200 --> 28:53.980
be right for us to go.

28:55.000 --> 28:55.860
Since Dong Xuan'er is going,

28:56.110 --> 28:57.050
Wu Xuan will go too.

28:57.200 --> 28:57.660
Exactly.

28:57.680 --> 28:58.660
- And they... - We don't want to see

28:58.680 --> 28:59.770
them acting all lovey-dovey.

28:59.920 --> 29:00.220
You know,

29:00.400 --> 29:01.140
he'll be like this.

29:02.350 --> 29:02.940
Yeah! Exactly.

29:03.030 --> 29:03.730
Dong Xuan'er.

29:04.240 --> 29:05.570
- Dong Xuan'er. - Right?

29:05.830 --> 29:07.220
How many times have I told you guys

29:07.350 --> 29:08.940
not to talk about Wu Xuan behind his back?

29:09.350 --> 29:10.420
You bring him up every time.

29:10.440 --> 29:10.940
He does this.

29:10.960 --> 29:12.090
- Right? - That's exactly how he is.

29:12.110 --> 29:13.000
- Am I wrong? - You shouldn't

29:13.000 --> 29:13.730
badmouth him.

29:14.030 --> 29:14.530
Come on.

29:14.550 --> 29:15.530
Say it to his face, then.

29:16.270 --> 29:16.810
Don't badmouth him

29:16.830 --> 29:18.530
- behind his back. - Fine, I'll say it to his face!

29:23.750 --> 29:25.010
Not this. I still need it.

29:30.830 --> 29:31.570
The Mystic Shield.

29:32.310 --> 29:33.330
That's my precious.

29:33.550 --> 29:34.330
Where did you get it?

29:41.350 --> 29:42.620
I really can't part with it.

29:43.030 --> 29:43.770
It hurts my heart.

29:48.720 --> 29:50.050
Those who want to go can't.

29:50.200 --> 29:52.250
Those who don't still must cough up a treasure.

29:59.960 --> 30:01.010
Maybe spirit herbs?

30:02.480 --> 30:03.530
They aren't worth that much.

30:04.110 --> 30:05.530
And I can grow more with the Green Vial.

30:10.960 --> 30:12.220
You really don't waste any time.

30:17.830 --> 30:18.570
You're giving it away?

30:20.920 --> 30:21.330
Here.

30:22.440 --> 30:23.290
Take a good look.

30:24.160 --> 30:26.140
This spirit herb is over a hundred years old.

30:26.640 --> 30:27.380
It's valuable.

30:35.510 --> 30:37.020
And I'm just giving it away?

30:45.240 --> 30:45.940
A barrier?

30:47.270 --> 30:49.180
Han, are you there?

30:49.520 --> 30:51.220
Open up and let me in!

30:51.920 --> 30:52.980
It's me, Dong Xuan'er!

30:53.000 --> 30:54.140
Come on, open the door!

31:05.000 --> 31:05.850
Little guy,

31:06.200 --> 31:07.610
you're way too cute.

31:07.790 --> 31:09.700
Are you one of Han's friends too?

31:11.200 --> 31:12.850
I'm also one of his friends.

31:13.000 --> 31:13.980
My name is Dong Xuan'er.

31:14.480 --> 31:16.420
Can you help me open the barrier?

31:34.720 --> 31:35.570
Thank you.

31:53.720 --> 31:55.140
Han?

31:57.960 --> 31:59.460
Han!

32:05.550 --> 32:06.770
How did you get in here?

32:11.110 --> 32:12.220
Wow.

32:12.400 --> 32:14.330
You'd betray your friends for a pretty face?

32:16.350 --> 32:16.850
Come here.

32:18.200 --> 32:18.740
Don't look.

32:18.830 --> 32:19.330
She's got enchantment.

32:19.720 --> 32:20.570
Don't look at her.

32:21.400 --> 32:22.050
Come on.

32:23.440 --> 32:24.380
Snap out of it.

32:26.350 --> 32:27.050
Han,

32:27.310 --> 32:29.660
I came to ask you for a spirit herb.

32:30.310 --> 32:31.850
Every herb here has its purpose.

32:32.240 --> 32:33.290
There are no extras.

32:35.920 --> 32:37.330
Are you upset?

32:37.830 --> 32:39.530
You're not happy going to the wedding

32:39.960 --> 32:40.740
with me?

32:41.680 --> 32:42.660
Don't think I don't know

32:42.760 --> 32:43.610
what's on your mind.

32:43.960 --> 32:45.140
You're annoyed with Senior Wu.

32:45.790 --> 32:47.010
So, you're using me as a shield.

32:48.960 --> 32:49.530
That's right.

32:49.870 --> 32:51.140
You're the only one in this valley

32:51.160 --> 32:52.460
who doesn't chase me around.

32:52.720 --> 32:54.660
Of course I'm using you as a shield.

33:01.000 --> 33:02.090
Since I don't chase you,

33:02.270 --> 33:03.330
stay out of my business.

33:04.440 --> 33:05.770
I'm not bothering you!

33:05.920 --> 33:06.900
You're no fun.

33:06.960 --> 33:09.180
Who'd want to go sightseeing with you?

33:09.550 --> 33:10.010
It's just

33:10.270 --> 33:11.140
no fun.

33:11.870 --> 33:13.250
If my master hadn't said

33:13.310 --> 33:14.530
it's safer with you,

33:14.830 --> 33:17.010
I wouldn't want to travel with you at all.

33:22.000 --> 33:22.700
Fine then.

33:23.440 --> 33:24.530
Let's make some ground rules.

33:25.200 --> 33:26.380
We each mind our own business

33:27.000 --> 33:27.700
on the road.

33:29.070 --> 33:29.700
Deal.

33:32.520 --> 33:33.610
Can you really stick to that?

33:40.480 --> 33:42.770
You spend all day with such a boring guy.

33:43.520 --> 33:44.610
Poor little thing.

33:50.550 --> 33:52.900
My master said we need to dress properly for the wedding.

33:53.200 --> 33:54.380
Aren't you going to change?

33:56.960 --> 33:58.220
I think this looks fine.

34:05.270 --> 34:06.850
Guess I was too subtle.

34:09.520 --> 34:10.610
I'll go get changed.

34:16.550 --> 34:17.330
Alright, I'm off.

34:21.870 --> 34:22.570
I'm leaving now.

34:22.800 --> 34:23.930
I'll come play with you later.

34:24.110 --> 34:24.740
Bye.

34:32.800 --> 34:33.370
Look.

34:33.910 --> 34:35.130
It's Han and Dong.

34:37.800 --> 34:39.050
They are leaving for the Yan Clan Stronghold.

34:43.040 --> 34:43.700
Han,

34:44.200 --> 34:46.180
are you giving that spirit herb

34:46.280 --> 34:47.370
to the bride?

34:54.800 --> 34:55.290
Han,

34:55.680 --> 34:56.980
do you know why I chose you

34:57.070 --> 34:58.700
to come with me this time?

34:59.480 --> 35:00.220
You already said it.

35:00.910 --> 35:01.940
I'm your human shield.

35:02.910 --> 35:03.330
That's true,

35:03.830 --> 35:05.740
but there's another important reason.

35:08.150 --> 35:08.740
Take a guess.

35:10.680 --> 35:11.260
I have no idea.

35:12.590 --> 35:13.940
Because you're the only one

35:13.960 --> 35:15.460
who looks at me normally

35:15.630 --> 35:17.260
and talks to me like a regular person.

35:18.760 --> 35:19.890
Don't blame others for that.

35:20.550 --> 35:21.460
Even dung beetles

35:21.720 --> 35:22.660
are attracted to you.

35:24.040 --> 35:25.220
It's not just dung beetles.

35:25.520 --> 35:26.810
Look at the flowers, plants,

35:27.150 --> 35:28.290
and your Treasure-Hunting Mouse.

35:28.390 --> 35:29.370
They all like me too.

35:35.310 --> 35:35.970
But still,

35:36.280 --> 35:38.010
sometimes I really wish people

35:38.030 --> 35:40.330
could treat me like they treat anyone else.

35:43.720 --> 35:44.970
Ordinary life

35:45.600 --> 35:47.100
is harder than you think.

35:48.030 --> 35:48.810
Besides,

35:49.390 --> 35:50.850
those seniors and juniors

35:50.870 --> 35:51.700
try to please you

35:51.950 --> 35:53.010
because of your enchantment.

35:54.080 --> 35:54.810
They can't help it.

35:57.640 --> 35:58.540
I see.

35:58.800 --> 36:00.180
So in your eyes,

36:00.430 --> 36:01.700
I'm someone who can't make friends

36:01.720 --> 36:03.060
without using enchantment?

36:04.240 --> 36:05.580
You know whether you used it or not.

36:06.310 --> 36:07.290
Even my mouse

36:07.800 --> 36:09.290
opened the gate for you.

36:10.350 --> 36:11.890
I didn't use enchantment on it.

36:14.760 --> 36:15.410
You didn't?

36:18.830 --> 36:19.970
I'm done talking to you.

36:20.280 --> 36:22.180
Right now, you just look plain and dull.

36:22.560 --> 36:23.580
You're boring me.

36:27.160 --> 36:27.740
Great.

36:29.560 --> 36:30.450
But I have to warn you,

36:31.510 --> 36:33.010
you shouldn't use enchantment carelessly.

36:33.470 --> 36:34.580
You'll get yourself in trouble.

36:37.800 --> 36:39.540
And how's that your business?

36:40.160 --> 36:41.580
This enchantment is part of me.

36:41.990 --> 36:43.540
It's not like I can choose to have it.

37:07.910 --> 37:09.260
I'm Feng Jun of the Yan Clan Stronghold.

37:10.120 --> 37:11.660
Are you here for the wedding banquet?

37:11.950 --> 37:12.410
Correct.

37:16.120 --> 37:18.180
So it's Han and Dong from Yellow Maple Valley.

37:18.390 --> 37:18.810
Wait here.

37:19.030 --> 37:20.220
I'll register you and arrange your lodging.

37:21.080 --> 37:22.260
Upper City.

37:22.350 --> 37:22.970
Register them.

37:24.020 --> 37:25.100
[Upper City]

37:26.240 --> 37:27.700
Even the tokens are made of jade.

37:27.990 --> 37:29.780
The Yan Clan Stronghold sure is extravagant.

37:31.080 --> 37:31.620
Sorry for the wait.

37:32.120 --> 37:33.330
This is your city access pass.

37:33.510 --> 37:35.370
You can use it to stay at a designated inn.

37:36.430 --> 37:36.850
Hold onto it.

37:38.160 --> 37:38.850
Feng,

37:39.350 --> 37:40.740
why are our tokens

37:40.760 --> 37:41.780
different from theirs?

37:43.470 --> 37:44.140
Apologies.

37:44.350 --> 37:45.450
There are more guests

37:45.470 --> 37:46.700
than we had expected.

37:46.800 --> 37:47.450
Only the inns

37:47.560 --> 37:49.100
in the Lower City still have rooms.

37:50.120 --> 37:50.620
I see.

37:51.080 --> 37:53.100
Why can't we stay in the Upper City?

37:55.760 --> 37:56.660
Please don't worry.

37:56.910 --> 37:57.890
Aside from the location,

37:58.120 --> 37:59.220
all the inns were chosen

37:59.310 --> 38:00.890
by the Lord of the Stronghold.

38:02.240 --> 38:03.010
We've even arranged

38:03.080 --> 38:04.540
a fireworks show tonight.

38:04.950 --> 38:06.100
You'll both enjoy it.

38:06.720 --> 38:07.850
Thank you, Feng.

38:11.680 --> 38:12.850
Feng,

38:13.160 --> 38:15.780
are the Upper City guest rooms really full?

38:18.950 --> 38:19.620
Are

38:20.470 --> 38:21.260
you

38:22.080 --> 38:22.930
sure?

38:26.600 --> 38:27.620
I'm such an idiot.

38:28.080 --> 38:29.580
How could I let such a beautiful lady

38:29.600 --> 38:30.580
stay in the Lower City?

38:31.160 --> 38:32.290
Isn't there still one upper room left?

38:32.470 --> 38:32.890
Let her have it.

38:32.980 --> 38:33.540
Quick.

38:34.640 --> 38:35.660
Here you go.

38:36.760 --> 38:37.890
Thank you, Feng.

39:00.350 --> 39:01.540
Who is that girl?

39:02.760 --> 39:04.850
You're blaming me for using enchantment again, aren't you?

39:06.240 --> 39:07.140
The gift of enchantment?

39:08.390 --> 39:09.180
Could she be

39:09.600 --> 39:10.740
connected to that old man?

39:13.950 --> 39:15.370
Interesting.

39:15.640 --> 39:18.290
Looks like it's about time someone taught that old man a lesson.

39:35.870 --> 39:36.970
Mid Foundation Establishment Stage.

39:37.390 --> 39:37.700
Don't look.

39:37.870 --> 39:38.290
Let's go.

39:41.580 --> 39:42.820
[Cloud Inn]

39:44.560 --> 39:45.220
Shopkeeper.

39:45.870 --> 39:46.290
One room.

39:46.720 --> 39:47.490
Coming, sir.

39:50.120 --> 39:51.490
Are you two staying together?

39:52.310 --> 39:53.140
We'll stay separately.

39:53.870 --> 39:54.700
Separately?

39:55.200 --> 39:56.010
But I'm afraid we only

39:56.080 --> 39:56.930
have one room left.

39:57.200 --> 39:57.700
It's fine.

39:57.830 --> 39:58.540
- Then... - You take it.

39:58.910 --> 39:59.740
I'll stay elsewhere.

40:00.280 --> 40:01.740
You're clearly avoiding me

40:02.310 --> 40:03.850
to ditch me in any way you can.

40:04.510 --> 40:04.930
Shopkeeper,

40:05.280 --> 40:05.850
show me the room.

40:06.280 --> 40:06.660
Right away.

40:08.910 --> 40:09.330
Fine then.

40:09.470 --> 40:10.970
Let's stick to the rules we agreed on.

40:11.030 --> 40:12.060
We'll mind our own business.

40:13.950 --> 40:14.810
Don't come looking for me.

40:20.470 --> 40:22.060
All the guests here are from the Seven Sects.

40:22.640 --> 40:23.850
There are even patrols outside.

40:24.390 --> 40:25.540
It should be a safe place.

40:26.800 --> 40:27.810
Let her calm down on her own.

40:28.430 --> 40:29.410
I'll take a breather too.

40:32.760 --> 40:33.810
Sir,

40:34.390 --> 40:35.260
don't get upset.

40:35.830 --> 40:36.410
Cheer her up.

40:36.640 --> 40:37.660
She'll be fine.

40:38.200 --> 40:39.060
No lasting grudges

40:39.470 --> 40:40.660
between companions.

40:40.800 --> 40:41.410
Exactly.

40:42.350 --> 40:43.410
Sorry you had to witness that.

40:43.680 --> 40:44.490
She's my junior,

40:44.760 --> 40:45.890
not my companion.

40:46.120 --> 40:46.890
Really not?

40:47.200 --> 40:47.850
Are you sure?

40:48.760 --> 40:49.620
Definitely not.

40:51.430 --> 40:52.490
You lost the bet.

40:52.560 --> 40:53.410
Hand over the gems.

40:55.080 --> 40:55.700
I'm Han Li.

40:56.200 --> 40:57.660
May I know how to address you?

40:58.240 --> 40:59.220
[Wuyouzi, Clear Void Sect]
Wuyouzi from Clear Void Sect.

40:59.870 --> 41:01.010
[Ba Chushui, Giant Sword Sect]
Ba Chushui from the Giant Sword Sect.

41:03.200 --> 41:04.100
You're

41:04.390 --> 41:06.100
also here for the Yan Clan wedding?

41:07.030 --> 41:08.010
Not exactly.

41:12.120 --> 41:12.850
Han,

41:13.430 --> 41:14.180
a word in private.

41:14.350 --> 41:15.450
Please.

41:24.430 --> 41:25.260
Han,

41:25.990 --> 41:28.290
have you heard any rumors about the Yan Clan Stronghold lately?

41:30.030 --> 41:30.970
They say this place

41:31.350 --> 41:32.220
is haunted by an evil.

41:33.120 --> 41:34.740
They feed on mortals and low-level cultivators,

41:35.120 --> 41:36.010
killing for pleasure.

41:36.310 --> 41:37.370
For the past three months,

41:37.760 --> 41:38.890
people have died every night.

41:40.240 --> 41:42.010
All while a Core Formation cultivator

41:42.560 --> 41:43.850
was guarding this place?

41:44.680 --> 41:46.540
The victims were mortals and low-level cultivators.

41:46.950 --> 41:48.010
Lord Yan is too busy

41:48.080 --> 41:48.970
marrying off his daughter.

41:49.910 --> 41:50.930
But rumor has it

41:51.240 --> 41:52.540
that to prevent evil from causing chaos,

41:52.870 --> 41:53.780
during tomorrow's wedding,

41:54.080 --> 41:56.370
Lord Yan will activate a powerful protective array.

41:57.310 --> 41:58.260
As for the two of us,

41:58.870 --> 42:00.330
we're here to catch the evil spirit.

42:02.910 --> 42:04.660
If you're interested,

42:05.030 --> 42:05.740
do join us, Han.

42:06.560 --> 42:07.700
I just arrived,

42:08.280 --> 42:09.620
and I need some rest tonight.

42:09.950 --> 42:10.660
So I'll pass for now.

42:11.120 --> 42:11.620
Goodbye.

42:12.870 --> 42:13.660
Take care, Han.

42:14.030 --> 42:14.450
Safe travels.

42:22.240 --> 42:22.970
An evil spirit?

42:24.470 --> 42:25.410
Feasting on mortals

42:25.680 --> 42:26.810
and low-level cultivators?

42:27.830 --> 42:28.580
I've never

42:28.830 --> 42:29.850
heard of this before.

42:31.200 --> 42:32.100
Just to be safe,

42:32.470 --> 42:33.660
I'd better look around

42:34.200 --> 42:35.330
and get a feel for the place.

42:53.740 --> 42:59.060
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:00.300 --> 43:05.700
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:05.820 --> 43:09.020
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:09.260 --> 43:11.500
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:11.900 --> 43:14.740
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:15.260 --> 43:19.220
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:20.060 --> 43:25.540
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

43:26.700 --> 43:31.980
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

43:32.580 --> 43:35.620
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

43:35.900 --> 43:38.020
♪Swept away by time♪

43:38.660 --> 43:41.300
♪Eyes once looked far♪

43:41.780 --> 43:45.740
♪Now lost in the shift♪

43:46.220 --> 43:49.060
♪Autumn winds stir♪

43:49.340 --> 43:51.260
♪Smoke curls once more♪

43:51.700 --> 43:54.140
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

43:54.460 --> 43:57.980
♪Returning to my eyes♪

43:58.540 --> 44:01.500
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:01.820 --> 44:04.740
♪Time lost its name♪

44:05.140 --> 44:07.980
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:08.380 --> 44:11.940
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:12.300 --> 44:15.140
♪The world has changed♪

44:15.540 --> 44:17.380
♪Beyond recall♪

44:17.940 --> 44:19.660
♪Time will fade♪

44:20.060 --> 44:24.860
♪All the words ever spoken♪

44:25.540 --> 44:28.420
♪Only this longing remains♪

44:28.900 --> 44:34.180
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

44:35.300 --> 44:41.940
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

44:42.420 --> 44:52.140
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
